    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG Ryan are pleased to present Courtneys Cottage, Bluepool Upper, Kanturk, Co. Cork to the market for sale. This charming two-bedroom semi-detached residence offers an excellent opportunity to acquire a character-filled home in a highly convenient location within Kanturk town.\n\nBuilt c.1925 and extending to approximately 70 sqm, Courtneys Cottage offers well-proportioned accommodation with a warm and welcoming feel throughout. A particular feature of the property is the double-height living room, which creates a wonderful sense of space and is complemented by a solid fuel stove, adding to the traditional character of the home.\n\nThe accommodation comprises two bedrooms, one bathroom and comfortable living space, providing a practical and manageable home that is likely to appeal to a wide range of purchasers, including first-time buyers, downsizers and investors.\n\nTo the rear of the property is a garden, providing valuable private outdoor space within the town. Access to the rear garden is through the house only.\n\nThe location is a key attraction, with Courtneys Cottage situated in Kanturk town and just a short walk from the town centre and its wide selection of shops, schools, cafés and everyday amenities. This convenient setting provides the benefit of having everything close at hand while enjoying the character and individuality of the property.\n\nVacant and chain free, Courtneys Cottage represents an attractive opportunity to acquire a distinctive two-bedroom residence in a central and convenient Kanturk location.\n\nViewing is highly recommended and is strictly by appointment with sole selling agents DNG Ryan.\n\nLiving room 4.3 x 4.9 stove, sky lights, timber flooring\n\nKitchen/dining room 3.6 x 5.1 tiled, fitted units, double doors to rear\n\nToilet 2.7 x 2.6 floor to ceiling tiled, electric shower\n\nBedroom 3.6 x 2.3\n\nBedroom 2.3 x 3.5\n\nKEY FEATURES:\n2 Bed, 1 Bath\nSemi-detached home\nMains sewage\nMains water\nExpands to C. 70sqm\nBuilt C. 1925\nExternally insulation\nAttic Insulation\nGarden to the rear (Access through house only)\nVacant and chain free\nLocated in Kanturk Town\nShort walk to all amenities\n\nThese particulars have been prepared by DNG John Ryan and whilst every care has been taken to ensure that these are accurate and correct, we are not responsible for any errors, omissions, inaccuracies, if the property is let, sold or withdrawn from sale or if it is not suitable for your purpose. These particulars are for information only and are given under the strict understanding that they do not form part of any contract. Neither whole nor any part of this document or any reference thereto may be included in any public document, circular or statement nor published without the written consent of DNG John Ryan."
      },
